-->Loops are used to execute the same code multiple times.
-->Swift provides different loops. Let's learn two important ones.

FOR and WHILE
for i in 1...5 {
    print(i)---->1 2 3 4 5
}
//A for loop is used when you know how many times you want to repeat something.

var i = 1

while i <= 5 {
    print(i)---->1 2 3 4 5
    i += 1
}
//A while loop executes as long as the condition is true.
